aches-are-plausible-nisq-era-testbeds-but-their-ability--31ec67369767.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-large-quantum-networks-require-reversible-interconnects-that-convert-quantum-sta--03b0b3a11218.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-linear-cross-entropy-benchmarking-provides-a-fidelity-measure-by-comparing-exper--4abac38b173d.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-lower-gate-error-rates-matter-both-because-they-allow-larger-uncorrected-nisq-ci--043e58605f51.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-measured-component-error-rates-under-simultaneous-operation-were-low-enough-to-s--6d6ae35745de.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-nisq-computers-with-roughly-50-to-a-few-hundred-qubits-mark-a-classically-hard-s--2d5ec194bedf.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-nisq-devices-are-best-understood-as-experimental-tools-for-exploring-many-body-q--fde7f9646dbb.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-noise-resilient-circuit-design-can-extend-nisq-computational-reach-but-it-may-tr--aed4bcfeaa39.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-quantum-computers-are-not-expected-to-efficiently-solve-hard-np-hard-combinatori--0d5f718c4d47.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-quantum-computers-have-credible-grounds-for-super-classical-power-because-of-kno--2f85bd581bbb.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-quantum-connectivity-gives-linked-nodes-a-state-space-that-scales-exponentially--50cc8b700a70.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-random-quantum-circuits-become-exponentially-harder-to-simulate-classically-as-q--f7cd81f80f31.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-scalable-fault-tolerant-quantum-computing-depends-on-quantum-error-correction-bu--cf48bc246343.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-scalable-quantum-networks-are-likely-to-be-heterogeneous-systems-that-combine-ca--dfe53fef0772.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-strong-cavity-qed-coupling-supplies-a-physical-regime-in-which-individual-atoms--9807d4e35625.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-the-demonstrated-speedup-is-specific-to-random-circuit-sampling-and-does-not-rem--47d4f349751e.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-the-dlcz-protocol-creates-heralded-entanglement-between-atomic-ensembles-by-inte--aa516185d3b2.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-the-largest-elided-53-qubit-20-cycle-circuits-yielded-f-xeb-2-24-0-21-10-3-over--0a24f12d0686.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-the-largest-random-circuits-combined-53-qubits-1-113-single-qubit-gates-430-two--c8ece98aae87.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/claims/claim-the-sycamore-superconducting-processor-created-random-circuit-quantum-states-on--2b4eeabd4063.json\n--- verification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/relations\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/relations/rel-04809370c2554a7ce66e03f99322178b11278091075f3a31292d80432a35612a.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/relations/rel-0cc6809d09fd08f105da9d6c0f467c109a91184a954876114432ac19ac72a1f5.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/relations/rel-0f155a4c952b90287e4b0d71d601e254bec68a9373fef704b216386834737b9c.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/relations/rel-153583aa6609adfa8935fe692fb9c6ab3153ad83c507479a7e639a4639669d67.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/relations/rel-1af95dc9d41e2d00a9981074719e9e5dee9ac3e88f78cd7eac4682e6f40c579e.json\nverification/example_site/spaces/quantum-physics/relations/rel-3829cfadc2de1fbd047e4c1cb4df2934c3c