        "body": "The experiment uses an integrated photonic processor rather than an abstract circuit simulation. Photon pairs encode the two-qubit input, phase shifters set state and measurement parameters, a CNOT supplies entangling capability, and detector counts feed the CPU. This grounds the feasibility claim in real optical hardware with identifiable strengths and imperfections.",
